[SPEAKER_00]: Like, if I talk one-on-one with somebody for hours, and I can understand more, more specifically where they're coming from, you can give more accurate... same like with a doctor, you know, you can give a general antibiotic, because you did not give him any details about your illness, just describe general symptoms, or he can give you exact thing that you need, if he can boil it down to it.

29
