[SPEAKER_00]: They wouldn't really understand it.

42
00:04:03,324 --> 00:04:11,630
[SPEAKER_00]: So, when I talk about enduring things on the right level, people think, okay, so I just need to mindlessly bear discomfort until the magic of Sotāpati happens.

43
00:04:11,690 --> 00:04:13,671
