65
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:09,762
[SPEAKER_00]: They're supposed to come up, if the virtue is done rightly.

66
00:06:09,862 --> 00:06:22,749
[SPEAKER_00]: So, if you think your virtue is great, and you're keeping the precepts, and you're perfectly restrained, and the mind is not coming up with anything, with no irrational attacks, and thoughts, and doubts, you're either fully enlightened, or you're doing it wrong.

67
00:06:22,769 --> 00:06:25,690
[SPEAKER_00]: It can't be, oh, but I'm doing it right, and my mind is just not doing any of this.

68
00:06:25,790 --> 00:06:27,191
[SPEAKER_00]: It will be coming up with stuff.

69
00:06:28,395 --> 00:06:32,620
