70
00:06:40,368 --> 00:06:40,648
[SPEAKER_01]: Right.

71
00:06:41,529 --> 00:06:41,770
[SPEAKER_00]: Right.

72
00:06:41,790 --> 00:06:44,473
[SPEAKER_00]: Because... And that's the thing.

73
00:06:44,533 --> 00:06:47,095
