00:28:28,731 --> 00:28:29,152
[SPEAKER_05]: Yeah.

394
00:28:29,172 --> 00:28:30,212
[SPEAKER_05]: Without me drinking.

395
00:28:30,812 --> 00:28:31,873
[SPEAKER_05]: So, it's

396
