00:31:22,391 --> 00:31:23,351
[SPEAKER_00]: There was no separate thing.

455
00:31:25,211 --> 00:31:32,333
[SPEAKER_00]: And that's why, like, the first stage of enlightenment is the person is referred to established in virtue, i.e.

456
00:31:32,713 --> 00:31:42,455
[SPEAKER_00]: the precepts became this training, became this mental level that I'm talking about, where now you know that's where the dhamma is, and that's why you don't need any more input or any other guidance.

457
00:31:42,536 --> 00:31:45,176
[SPEAKER_00]: You know exactly where it is, and you know exactly what needs to be purified.

458
